@startuml Template
title [Feature Name] Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant LWC as "Lightning Web Component"
participant Controller as "Apex Controller"
participant Service as "Business Service"
participant Database as "Salesforce Database"

== Main Flow ==
User -> LWC: [User Action]
LWC -> Controller: [Method Call](parameters)
Controller -> Service: [Business Logic](data)

alt [Condition]
    Service -> Database: [SOQL Query]
    Database --> Service: [Records]
    Service -> Controller: [Success Response]
else [Error Condition]
    Service --> Controller: [Error/Exception]
end

Controller --> LWC: [Response Data]
LWC --> User: [UI Update/Feedback]

== Additional Flow (Optional) ==
note over User, Database
    Additional notes about
    the flow or business rules
end note
@enduml